{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06498","headline":"采莲词 · 储光羲","name":"采莲词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浅渚荇花繁，深潭菱叶疎。\n独往方自得，耻邀淇上姝。\n广江无术阡，大泽绝方隅。\n浪中海童语，流下鲛人居。\n春鴈时隐舟，新萍复满湖。\n采采乘日暮，不思贤与愚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06498.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06498","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}